('Obby 30: Color Rush','obby-30-color-rush-gm81366','Are you ready to go from beginner to master? Obby 30: Color Rush is a classic 3D platformer that takes you through 30 flawlessly designed levels. Start in the easy green zones and fight your way through fiery red trials, where every platform tests your patience and precision. What awaits inside:  30 Levels of Evolution: Feel your skills grow with every step. Level design isn''t just about traps - it''s about speed and reflex puzzles.  Star System: Simply finishing is only the beginning. Collect all the in-game stars to prove you are the true Obby champion!  Race Against Time: Confident in your speed? Run as fast as you can!','Are you ready to go from beginner to master? Obby 30: Color Rush is a classic 3D platformer that takes you through 30 flawlessly designed levels. Start in the e','https://img.gamemonetize.com/dcdoe6b5ajfv2f1r1cefnv6paq6ole25/512x384.jpg','https://html5.gamemonetize.co/dcdoe6b5ajfv2f1r1cefnv6paq6ole25/','GAMEMONETIZE','81366',12,'{"3D","3D Games","Arcade","Avoid","Casual","Hypercasual","Jumping","Minecraft","Obstacle","Platform"}',800,600,true,false,false,true,11340),
('Liquid Color Sort','liquid-color-sort-gm81000','Enjoy a fun and relaxing puzzle experience in Liquid Color Sort! Your objective is to sort colorful liquids into separate tubes until each tube contains only one color. Use logic, planning, and problem-solving skills to complete each level. While the rules are simple, the puzzles become more challenging as new colors and tube arrangements are introduced. Think carefully before each move and find the most efficient way to organize the liquids. With satisfying animations and calming gameplay, Liquid Color Sort is perfect for players who enjoy brain-training puzzles and relaxing challenges.','Enjoy a fun and relaxing puzzle experience in Liquid Color Sort! Your objective is to sort colorful liquids into separate tubes until each tube contains only on','https://img.gamemonetize.com/7qkj72xabfgbojt1gr2nl4elzpom74q6/512x384.jpg','https://html5.gamemonetize.co/7qkj72xabfgbojt1gr2nl4elzpom74q6/','GAMEMONETIZE','81000',1,'{"2D","Casual","Fun","Hypercasual","Puzzle"}',800,600,true,false,false,true,7864),
('Adventruse Hail Game','adventruse-hail-game-gm80991','Get ready for a fun and challenging color-matching adventure! In Adventurous Hail, colorful hailstones fall from above, and your mission is to place the correct color converter beneath each one. Match the colors perfectly to transform hail into beautiful snowflakes and keep the game going. Stay focused and react quickly one wrong color match will end the game! Test your reflexes, accuracy, and speed as the falling hail gets faster and more challenging. How long can you survive and achieve the highest score?','Get ready for a fun and challenging color-matching adventure! In Adventurous Hail, colorful hailstones fall from above, and your mission is to place the correct','https://img.gamemonetize.com/wbo9uaekivs0ogs6g7th2dt91isivfaf/512x384.jpg','https://html5.gamemonetize.co/wbo9uaekivs0ogs6g7th2dt91isivfaf/','GAMEMONETIZE','80991',1,'{"2D","Adventure","Casual","Fun"}',800,600,true,false,false,true,846),
('Draw Paint Spray Game','draw-paint-spray-game-gm80934','Draw Paint Spray Game is a fun and creative coloring game where players can draw, paint, and spray beautiful colors on different objects, pictures, and designs. This game is perfect for players who enjoy art games, painting games, drawing games, coloring games, and relaxing creative activities.','Draw Paint Spray Game is a fun and creative coloring game where players can draw, paint, and spray beautiful colors on different objects, pictures, and designs.','https://img.gamemonetize.com/jbh19i4oxb4iwpmiqjmm8moibhgcxu67/512x384.jpg','https://html5.gamemonetize.co/jbh19i4oxb4iwpmiqjmm8moibhgcxu67/','GAMEMONETIZE','80934',1,'{"2026 games","Casual","Drawing","Fun","painting","Puzzle","Relaxation"}',800,600,true,false,false,true,5676),
('Speed Master Cars','speed-master-cars-gm67100','Speed Master Car is an exciting racing game that puts you behind the wheel of powerful sports cars. Drive at high speeds, avoid traffic and obstacles, collect rewards, and complete challenging missions. Improve your driving skills, unlock new vehicles, and upgrade their performance to become the ultimate speed master. With smooth controls, dynamic tracks, and fast-paced gameplay, the game offers an adrenaline-filled racing experience for players of all ages.','Speed Master Car is an exciting racing game that puts you behind the wheel of powerful sports cars. Drive at high speeds, avoid traffic and obstacles, collect r','https://img.gamemonetize.com/60egm0rxxecnozu81nd5breq6f4kjzhg/512x384.jpg','https://html5.gamemonetize.co/60egm0rxxecnozu81nd5breq6f4kjzhg/','GAMEMONETIZE','67100',8,'{"2026 games","Action","Adventure","Car"}',800,600,true,false,false,true,2467),
('WANTED','wanted-gm80788','It was just another job. Pick up a few guys, drive them across town, get paid. Easy money. Yeah... about that. Turns out your passengers just robbed a bank, and now every cop in the city wants your head. Congratulations, youre the getaway driver now, whether you like it or not. WANTED! is an over-the-top arcade chase game. Weave through traffic, grab the cash, and outrun the law across 6 wild worlds. Smash a car, crash a barrier, run a cop off the road... and watch your wanted level climb. The hotter you get, the more police pile on, and the more insane the chase becomes. Start in a beat-up little hatchback and work your way up to monster tr','It was just another job. Pick up a few guys, drive them across town, get paid. Easy money. Yeah... about that. Turns out your passengers just robbed a bank, and','https://img.gamemonetize.com/t8ipk9098ihbcexi2g2gryuarbj3x2l6/512x384.jpg','https://html5.gamemonetize.co/t8ipk9098ihbcexi2g2gryuarbj3x2l6/','GAMEMONETIZE','80788',7,'{"Action","Cars","Police","Race","run"}',960,600,true,false,false,true,1057),
('Apex Racer','apex-racer-gm81190','Drive a fast race car on a 3D circuit and chase the perfect lap. Track your lap and sector times, beat your best, and unlock faster cars as you go.','Drive a fast race car on a 3D circuit and chase the perfect lap. Track your lap and sector times, beat your best, and unlock faster cars as you go.','https://img.gamemonetize.com/ia64qw9tvs7mc0nb29d83462r7tzw2fr/512x384.jpg','https://html5.gamemonetize.co/ia64qw9tvs7mc0nb29d83462r7tzw2fr/','GAMEMONETIZE','81190',2,'{"3D","Cars","Driving","Race","Racing"}',800,600,true,false,false,true,5509),
('Dot Dodge','dot-dodge-gm80997','Put your reflexes to the test in Dot Dodge, an exciting arcade game that challenges your timing, precision, and focus. Control a rotating shield and defend the center from incoming dots. Rotate at the perfect moment to block the approaching dots and keep your score climbing. The gameplay is simple to learn but difficult to master. As you progress, the speed increases and the challenge becomes more intense, requiring quick reactions and sharp concentration. Stay alert, dodge danger, and see how long you can survive in this addictive endless challenge!','Put your reflexes to the test in Dot Dodge, an exciting arcade game that challenges your timing, precision, and focus. Control a rotating shield and defend the ','https://img.gamemonetize.com/ndwjf6xvpwr7r45nktqt0xhvi61k6ub5/512x384.jpg','https://html5.gamemonetize.co/ndwjf6xvpwr7r45nktqt0xhvi61k6ub5/','GAMEMONETIZE','80997',1,'{"Best","Best Games","Block","Fun","Hypercasual","Puzzle"}',800,600,true,false,false,true,5494),
('Batrix','batrix-gm81299','Batrix is a clicker-game designed and made easy for kids where you have to click on bats coming from front and keep clicking untill they die or crash. The game is easy clicker one which kids would love a lot! Have fun:)','Batrix is a clicker-game designed and made easy for kids where you have to click on bats coming from front and keep clicking untill they die or crash. The game ','https://img.gamemonetize.com/gn1bntribsmm5zc8aadhjkbdhizqtmtr/512x384.jpg','https://html5.gamemonetize.co/gn1bntribsmm5zc8aadhjkbdhizqtmtr/','GAMEMONETIZE','81299',12,'{"Casual","Clicker"}',800,600,true,false,false,true,14896),
('FormWise','formwise-gm81294','FormWise is a shape-identification which comes with flashy shapes. You have heart, circle, square, rhombus and what not as shapes! Kids going to love this puzzle while there is a learning section too in case you are unfamiliar with these shapes :) Have fun!','FormWise is a shape-identification which comes with flashy shapes. You have heart, circle, square, rhombus and what not as shapes! Kids going to love this puzzl','https://img.gamemonetize.com/sj1y1skjlbpxbo9o2lllstla77s2v521/512x384.jpg','https://html5.gamemonetize.co/sj1y1skjlbpxbo9o2lllstla77s2v521/','GAMEMONETIZE','81294',1,'{"Arcade","Casual","Puzzle"}',800,600,true,false,false,true,1703),
('Cute Pony Memory Quest','cute-pony-memory-quest-gm81525','Cute Pony Memory Quest is a fun and colorful memory matching game for players of all ages! Join an adorable little pony on a cheerful adventure across beautiful green meadows as you flip cards and search for matching pairs. Test your memory, improve your concentration, and challenge yourself through increasingly exciting levels. Can you remember where every matching pony is hidden? Start your memory quest and find them all!','Cute Pony Memory Quest is a fun and colorful memory matching game for players of all ages! Join an adorable little pony on a cheerful adventure across beautiful','https://img.gamemonetize.com/auf9i9301g8ienuep4p411yh11nbdq9x/512x384.jpg','https://html5.gamemonetize.co/auf9i9301g8ienuep4p411yh11nbdq9x/','GAMEMONETIZE','81525',1,'{"Arcade","Brain","Fun","Hypercasual","Kids","Memory","Mobile","Pony","Puzzle"}',800,600,true,false,false,true,3757),
('Wolfoo Escape','wolfoo-escape-gm81543','Wolfoo Escape is a kid-friendly trap-dodging platformer. Join Wolfoo, Piggy, and Pando as they tiptoe through witch Kats mysterious rooms, each one packed with hidden traps. Move carefully, time your jumps, grab the stars, and dash to the glowing door to clear all 12 levels. Simple controls make it easy for little players to pick up, while trickier trap layouts keep older kids challenged. Choose your favorite character, earn three stars on every stage, and see if you can help everyone escape safely. Bright cartoon visuals, gentle challenge, and quick levels make it perfect for short play sessions on desktop and mobile','Wolfoo Escape is a kid-friendly trap-dodging platformer. Join Wolfoo, Piggy, and Pando as they tiptoe through witch Kats mysterious rooms, each one packed with ','https://img.gamemonetize.com/go97vzukbc3diw45xpt44s3fwrslr91w/512x384.jpg','https://html5.gamemonetize.co/go97vzukbc3diw45xpt44s3fwrslr91w/','GAMEMONETIZE','81543',7,'{"Adventure"}',1280,720,true,false,false,true,8442),
('Math Game 3D','math-game-3d-gm81319','Math Game 3D is a fun and educational HTML5 puzzle game that challenges your math skills. Drag the numbered cubes onto the correct math expressions to solve each equation. Every correct answer removes a gray tile and gradually reveals the hidden picture underneath. Enjoy colorful graphics, smooth gameplay, relaxing music, and responsive controls in this engaging learning adventure for all ages.','Math Game 3D is a fun and educational HTML5 puzzle game that challenges your math skills. Drag the numbered cubes onto the correct math expressions to solve eac','https://img.gamemonetize.com/ib867ueh659ynnkl4gmpa41oqx8xardm/512x384.jpg','https://html5.gamemonetize.co/ib867ueh659ynnkl4gmpa41oqx8xardm/','GAMEMONETIZE','81319',1,'{"Brain","Casual","Family","Kids","mapi games","Math","Puzzle"}',1024,768,true,false,false,true,8348),
('Car Evolution Pro : Math Gates','car-evolution-pro-math-gates-gm80960','Car Evolution Pro : Math Gates turns math practice into a race! Drive down the road to the question gates. Each gate shows a math problem with two answer lanes - steer through the correct one. Answer enough correctly to pass the level and unlock a brand-new part for your car. Watch it evolve from a bare frame into a fully built machine, level by level.','Car Evolution Pro : Math Gates turns math practice into a race! Drive down the road to the question gates. Each gate shows a math problem with two answer lanes ','https://img.gamemonetize.com/sqtuqupfoswoie8rutb8035178dem34x/512x384.jpg','https://html5.gamemonetize.co/sqtuqupfoswoie8rutb8035178dem34x/','GAMEMONETIZE','80960',2,'{"1 Player","3D","Brain","Car","car tuning","Cars","Casual","Educational","Fun","Hypercasual"}',800,600,true,false,false,true,1239),
('Mini Car Runner   Meme Games','mini-car-runner-meme-games-gm81301','Mini Car Runner - Meme Games is a fast-paced 3D car running game packed with hilarious meme energy. Jump behind the wheel of your mini car and race down endless roads while dodging traffic, obstacles, and other vehicles that get in your way. The further you drive, the faster things get, so keep your reflexes sharp and your eyes on the road! Collect coins along the way, unlock fun new cars, and chase the highest score you can reach. With its bright cartoon visuals, silly meme-inspired style, and simple one-touch controls, this arcade racer is easy to pick up but tough to put down. Perfect for quick play sessions, Mini Car Runner challenges you to beat your own best distance again and again. How far can you drive before you crash? Play now and find out!','Mini Car Runner - Meme Games is a fast-paced 3D car running game packed with hilarious meme energy. Jump behind the wheel of your mini car and race down endless','https://img.gamemonetize.com/5sh8t4wul1u5743j9cd6jap365ow17b3/512x384.jpg','https://html5.gamemonetize.co/5sh8t4wul1u5743j9cd6jap365ow17b3/','GAMEMONETIZE','81301',2,'{"3D","Brainrot","Car","Cars","Driving","endless","Fun","Racing","run","running"}',800,600,true,false,false,true,12681),
('Color Loom Puzzle','color-loom-puzzle-gm80753','Color Loom Puzzle is a vibrant and engaging puzzle game where colorful threads descend through multiple columns, waiting to be completed. Match each thread with the correct spool of the same color to fill it and clear objectives. With limited spool slots available, every move matters. Plan ahead, manage your space wisely, and complete all required threads to overcome challenging levels. Test your strategy, organization, and puzzle-solving skills as you weave your way through increasingly complex challenges.','Color Loom Puzzle is a vibrant and engaging puzzle game where colorful threads descend through multiple columns, waiting to be completed. Match each thread with','https://img.gamemonetize.com/i5d7vvyypsq5qxpurxx8g7n23hgztazt/512x384.jpg','https://html5.gamemonetize.co/i5d7vvyypsq5qxpurxx8g7n23hgztazt/','GAMEMONETIZE','80753',1,'{"2026 games","amazing","Best","Best Games","Casual","Color","Hypercasual","Knight","Mind","Puzzle"}',720,1280,true,false,false,true,1241),
('Balloon Escape','balloon-escape-gm80809','Balloon Escape is a fun endless arcade adventure where you control a hot air balloon and fly higher through the sky while avoiding dangerous obstacles. Collect coins and gems to unlock new balloon skins, beat your high score, and challenge yourself to survive as long as possible. The higher you fly, the more difficult the journey becomes. Enjoy smooth controls, colorful visuals, and endless gameplay designed for both desktop and mobile devices.','Balloon Escape is a fun endless arcade adventure where you control a hot air balloon and fly higher through the sky while avoiding dangerous obstacles. Collect ','https://img.gamemonetize.com/woe2rmrrsam2dn5agntixjim9n793yy1/512x384.jpg','https://html5.gamemonetize.co/woe2rmrrsam2dn5agntixjim9n793yy1/','GAMEMONETIZE','80809',7,'{"Adventure","Arcade","Ballon","Casual","fly","Highscore","Hypercasual","sky"}',960,540,true,false,false,true,7975),
('Funny Cars','funny-cars-gm80884','Get ready for a crazy driving adventure! Race through busy roads, avoid obstacles, dodge traffic, and survive increasingly difficult challenges. Funny Cars combines fast-paced arcade action, colorful visuals, and exciting gameplay for players of all ages. How far can you go without crashing?','Get ready for a crazy driving adventure! Race through busy roads, avoid obstacles, dodge traffic, and survive increasingly difficult challenges. Funny Cars comb','https://img.gamemonetize.com/mbvq8ckgstjhh4rjayujdgd11u3380e0/512x384.jpg','https://html5.gamemonetize.co/mbvq8ckgstjhh4rjayujdgd11u3380e0/','GAMEMONETIZE','80884',7,'{"1 Player","3D","Car","Driving","Fun","Levels","Traffic","tree","trucks","Unity3D"}',800,600,true,false,false,true,14522),
('FIFA World Cup Jigsaw','fifa-world-cup-jigsaw-gm81323','FIFA World Cup Jigsaw Puzzle is a game where you are presented with a total of twelve different, but always interesting pictures with famous football players from the World Cup, each of which has four sets of fragments. The choice is free. You can choose any picture and any set of fragments according to your level and experience in assembling puzzles. In addition, during the construction you can add or disable the rotation option and the background display. Enjoy the game and get ready.','FIFA World Cup Jigsaw Puzzle is a game where you are presented with a total of twelve different, but always interesting pictures with famous football players fr','https://img.gamemonetize.com/r4uajbh1wyesosbb12k2hi2tl4izze2m/512x384.jpg','https://html5.gamemonetize.co/r4uajbh1wyesosbb12k2hi2tl4izze2m/','GAMEMONETIZE','81323',1,'{"1 Player","Football","Fun","Funny","Jigsaw","Kids","Skill","Soccer","Sport","Sports"}',1920,1080,true,false,false,true,2007),
('Ninjas Return ','ninjas-return-gm81292','Help our ninja hero save his beloved wife from the evil Dark Ninja! To progress, you must explore the forest and collect exactly 3 pink stars in each level. Finding them all unlocks a magical portal at the finish line, showering the area in falling sakura leaves. Enter the portal to reach the next stage. Complete your journey to save your wife waiting at the final level!','Help our ninja hero save his beloved wife from the evil Dark Ninja! To progress, you must explore the forest and collect exactly 3 pink stars in each level. Fin','https://img.gamemonetize.com/plv7w6gtqdqh9vlpspimv5j1hyxgi8v8/512x384.jpg','https://html5.gamemonetize.co/plv7w6gtqdqh9vlpspimv5j1hyxgi8v8/','GAMEMONETIZE','81292',8,'{"Ninja","Ninjago","Platform","Princess","Sword"}',800,600,true,false,false,true,10946),
('Backroom Exit','backroom-exit-gm81327','Are you ready to face the eerie emptiness of the Backrooms? In Backroom Exit, a tense first-person escape game, you find yourself trapped in a disturbing world of yellow walls and endless corridors. Your only objective is to find the exit, but it wont be easy. Explore the chilling environment, search for hidden objects, and gather clues to unravel the mysteries that surround you. Youll need to use your wits to solve clever puzzles, combine objects, and discover how to unlock the door to freedom before the atmosphere completely engulfs you.','Are you ready to face the eerie emptiness of the Backrooms? In Backroom Exit, a tense first-person escape game, you find yourself trapped in a disturbing world ','https://img.gamemonetize.com/pj2snitr497wrrxhhghfc3mqjvvwywmf/512x384.jpg','https://html5.gamemonetize.co/pj2snitr497wrrxhhghfc3mqjvvwywmf/','GAMEMONETIZE','81327',1,'{"Escape","Room","Unity3D"}',1024,768,true,false,false,true,11934),
('Vegetable Spelling Puzzle','vegetable-spelling-puzzle-gm81329','In the game, you have to look at the vegetables and write their names in the box below to complete the word. As soon as you complete the word, your level will be finished. To play more games like this, visit crazycubix.com.','In the game, you have to look at the vegetables and write their names in the box below to complete the word. As soon as you complete the word, your level will b','https://img.gamemonetize.com/stkfi0d0w8bz1x9wx7gzzhojh1stm8nv/512x384.jpg','https://html5.gamemonetize.co/stkfi0d0w8bz1x9wx7gzzhojh1stm8nv/','GAMEMONETIZE','81329',1,'{"Adventure","Puzzle"}',800,600,true,false,false,true,4090),
('TrashTide','trashtide-gm81276','TrashTide is a fun and relaxing ocean cleanup adventure where every catch counts! Dive beneath the waves and help restore the sea by collecting floating trash while carefully avoiding fish and other marine life. Every piece of waste you collect makes the ocean cleaner, but grabbing the wrong thing will cost you valuable points. With simple controls and satisfying gameplay, TrashTide is easy to play yet challenging to master. Stay focused, react quickly, and see how clean you can make the ocean! Features Fun and addictive trash-collecting gameplay Avoid fish and protect marine life Bright, colorful underwater environments','TrashTide is a fun and relaxing ocean cleanup adventure where every catch counts! Dive beneath the waves and help restore the sea by collecting floating trash w','https://img.gamemonetize.com/jbihpzo5t0753sic5drfhtwjn9cngv6g/512x384.jpg','https://html5.gamemonetize.co/jbihpzo5t0753sic5drfhtwjn9cngv6g/','GAMEMONETIZE','81276',1,'{"Collecting","Fish","water"}',800,600,true,false,false,true,4228),
('ReefRescue','reefrescue-gm81278','ReefRescue is a fun underwater adventure where every piece of trash you collect helps protect the ocean! Take control of a brave little seahorse and swim through colorful reefs, collecting floating waste while carefully avoiding fish and other sea creatures. Stay alert, react quickly, and keep the ocean clean without disturbing marine life. With simple controls and engaging gameplay, ReefRescue is easy to pick up and enjoyable for players of all ages. Challenge your reflexes, improve your timing, and become the hero of the reef!','ReefRescue is a fun underwater adventure where every piece of trash you collect helps protect the ocean! Take control of a brave little seahorse and swim throug','https://img.gamemonetize.com/ranyzu94kueenqvnwuxf5saub5uumdwl/512x384.jpg','https://html5.gamemonetize.co/ranyzu94kueenqvnwuxf5saub5uumdwl/','GAMEMONETIZE','81278',12,'{"Animal","Casual","catch","water"}',800,600,true,false,false,true,2490),
('PondHero','pondhero-gm81275','PondHero is a fun and challenging memory puzzle adventure where every step matters! Study the safe path as it appears across the pond, then watch it disappear. Your mission is to guide the brave little frog along the exact same route using only your memory. One wrong move, and youll have to try again! As you progress, the paths become longer, trickier, and more rewarding. Test your memory, improve your concentration, and see if you can conquer every challenge. Game Features: 40+ handcrafted levels with increasing difficulty Simple one-touch controls Fun memory-based gameplay thats easy to learn Cute frog and colorful pond-themed visuals','PondHero is a fun and challenging memory puzzle adventure where every step matters! Study the safe path as it appears across the pond, then watch it disappear. ','https://img.gamemonetize.com/i0ls0z1jfyvauimh5g7xlm26r0hjidm0/512x384.jpg','https://html5.gamemonetize.co/i0ls0z1jfyvauimh5g7xlm26r0hjidm0/','GAMEMONETIZE','81275',1,'{"Casual","frog","Memory","Puzzle"}',800,600,true,false,false,true,2185)
