('Coin Drop 3D','coin-drop-3d-gm81122','Get that golden coin into the bucket; sounds easy, until physics gets involved. Tap the wooden planks and crates to knock them away at just the right moment and watch the coin roll, bounce and tumble its way down. One wrong move and it rolls right past the target. 24 levels packed with wobbly towers, tilted ramps and tricky setups that get harder as you go. Simple to understand, surprisingly satisfying to master. Think before you tap!','Get that golden coin into the bucket; sounds easy, until physics gets involved. Tap the wooden planks and crates to knock them away at just the right moment and','https://img.gamemonetize.com/aye534jhdyl82pata95dlzgyj82run0q/512x384.jpg','https://html5.gamemonetize.co/aye534jhdyl82pata95dlzgyj82run0q/','GAMEMONETIZE','81122',1,'{"mapi games","Physics","Puzzle"}',1024,768,true,false,false,true,13720),
('Weapon Run','weapon-run-gm81238','Weapon Run is an exciting action runner game where speed, smart choices, and powerful weapons lead you to victory. Run through thrilling levels, collect stronger weapons, avoid dangerous obstacles, and defeat enemies waiting at the finish line. Every level offers a new challenge that tests your reflexes, timing, and strategy.','Weapon Run is an exciting action runner game where speed, smart choices, and powerful weapons lead you to victory. Run through thrilling levels, collect stronge','https://img.gamemonetize.com/3mvlbgcro82sjdweigypwqied6iflvtz/512x384.jpg','https://html5.gamemonetize.co/3mvlbgcro82sjdweigypwqied6iflvtz/','GAMEMONETIZE','81238',4,'{"2026 games","Action","Adventure","Best Games","Casual","Shooting","weapons"}',800,600,true,false,false,true,6965),
