('Tapping on Fruit','tapping-on-fruit-gm78219','*Knock the Fruit* is a casual mini-game belonging to the match-and-eliminate genre. The gameplay mechanics are as follows: set within a 9x9 grid matrix, the core objective is to eliminate adjacent fruits of the same color to meet the target score required for each level. Players can eliminate adjacent fruits-either vertically and horizontally (in Normal Mode) or in all eight directions (in Hammer Mode)-simply by tapping on a fruit. Points are awarded for eliminating two or more fruits in a single move, with the score calculation dependent on both the quantity of fruits eliminated and the current level number. The game features two built-in','*Knock the Fruit* is a casual mini-game belonging to the match-and-eliminate genre. The gameplay mechanics are as follows: set within a 9x9 grid matrix, the cor','https://img.gamemonetize.com/imebx29rrsjqqz8uvcsazbc1cr51ttzw/512x384.jpg','https://html5.gamemonetize.co/imebx29rrsjqqz8uvcsazbc1cr51ttzw/','GAMEMONETIZE','78219',12,'{"1 Player","2D"}',720,1280,true,false,false,true,5262),
